                                        <apex:outputpanel >
                                            <div class="blockHeader textlabel"><h3>What to look for</h3></div> <br/>
                                            <div>
                                                <ul class="removeMargin textlabel lightInsight">
                                                    <li>Business Drivers: Deeper understanding of business drivers, pain, and THEIR IMPACT. (Check the Industry Tab in SFDC for pain points)</li>
                                                    <li>What is the business impact of the problems the company is experiencing?</li>
                                                    <li>What is the business impact of the communication features lacking ?</li>
                                                </ul>
                                            </div><br/>


                                            <div class="blockHeader textlabel"><h3>Impact Questions</h3></div> <br/>
                                            <div>
                                                <ul class="removeMargin textlabel lightInsight">
                                                    <li>What is the impact of solving ______ problem? What is the impact of not solving ______ problem? </li>
                                                    <li>How would you quantify ? How does that affect your employees/customers? </li>
                                                    <li>What will happen if nothing changes?  </li>
                                                    <li>What will be the consequences of this problem continuing?  How are you measuring it?</li>
                                                    <li>How are you quantifying the pain and the potential ROI of solving it?</li>
                                                </ul>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <apex:outputLabel styleclass="textlabel"  value="Impact"/>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <apex:inputTextarea rows="4"   styleclass="notes impact"  value="{!lq.Impact__c}" onchange="setValToElement($(this).val(), $('.impactSum'));"/>
                                            </div>
                                        </apex:outputpanel>
                                    </apex:panelGrid>
                                </div>

                                <!-- ###################################### Competitive Landscape ###################################### -->
                                <div id="box7" class="tabdiv">
