                                        <apex:outputpanel >
                                            <div class="blockHeader textlabel"><h3>What to look for</h3></div> <br/>
                                            <div>
                                                <ul class="removeMargin textlabel lightInsight">
                                                    <li>What does the Competitive Landscape look like?</li>
                                                    <li>Who is the primary competitor in this deal? Is it the current installed provider?</li>
                                                    <li>Who are the other competitors involved</li>
                                                    <li>What is the competitive strategy to deal with the competition?</li>
                                                    <li>What other solutions being considered? Why?</li>
                                                </ul>
                                            </div><br/>
                                            <div class="blockHeader textlabel"><h3>Discovery Questions</h3></div> <br/>
                                            <div>
                                                <ul class="removeMargin textlabel lightInsight">
                                                    <li>Tell me about the competitive landscape for this project</li>
                                                    <li>Elaborate on the other companies you are speaking with</li>
                                                    <li>What possible obstacles might cause this project to be delayed or die?</li>
                                                    <li>What are the must-haves in your relationship with your next provider?</li>
                                                    <li>What is your thinking behind comparing the multiple vendors?</li>
                                                    <li>How did you come up with the vendors you are exploring?</li>
                                                </ul>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <apex:outputLabel styleclass="textlabel"  value="Competitive Landscape" />
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <apex:inputTextarea rows="8"  styleclass="competitiveLandscape"  value="{!lq.Competitive_Landscape__c}" onchange="setValToElement($(this).val(), $('.competitiveLandscapeSum'));"/>
                                            </div>
                                        </apex:outputpanel>
                                    </apex:panelGrid>
