                                        <apex:outputpanel >
                                            <div class="blockHeader textlabel"><h3>What to look for</h3></div> <br/>
                                            <div>
                                                <ul class="removeMargin textlabel lightInsight">
                                                    <li>When obtaining prospect wish lists, the rule of thumb is to get the entire list first, then start to layer with open-ended questions.</li>
                                                    <li>Capabilities beyond just the features (flexibility, manageability...)?</li>
                                                    <li>Vendor attributes (service, support, responsiveness)</li>
                                                </ul>
                                            </div><br/>
                                            <div class="blockHeader textlabel"><h3>Ideal Situation Questions</h3></div> <br/>
                                            <div>
                                                <ul class="removeMargin textlabel lightInsight">
                                                    <li>Ideally, how would you draw up your communications capabilities for the future? </li>
                                                    <li>Describe for me what an ideal solution would look like for your company.</li>
                                                    <li>If you could wave a magic wand, how would you ideally like to communicate with employees and customers?</li>
                                                    <li>What are your thoughts on…</li>
                                                    <li>In a perfect world, what would that look like?</li>
                                                </ul>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <apex:outputLabel styleclass="textlabel"  value="Ideal Situation"/>
                                            </div>
                                            <div>
                                                <apex:inputTextarea rows="4"   styleclass="notes idealSituation"  value="{!lq.Ideal_Situation__c}" onchange="setValToElement($(this).val(), $('.idealSituationSum'));"/>
                                            </div>
                                        </apex:outputpanel>
                                    </apex:panelGrid>
                                </div>


